[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Fugaaa! Fugagaga!\\c\\nI\u2019m a Pok\u00E9mon! Have a battle with me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Listen for a second.\\c\\nScorbunny and Sizzlipede are different species,\\nbut they\u2019re still both Pok\u00E9mon.\\c\\nScorbunny and I are different species, just like\\nSizzlipede and I are different, too.\\c\\nIf you think about it that way, there\u2019s no problem\\nwith calling me a Pok\u00E9mon. I don\u2019t mind."
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "What? You don\u2019t have to worry about me.\\nEven I know it\u2019s pretty lofty logic.\\c\\nI...I wanted to become a Pok\u00E9mon once."
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You can be one"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Well...good luck with that"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Hey, I\u2019ve got it! A change of fashion style could\\nchange the way I feel, too!\\c\\nBasically, if I can make myself feel the way a\\nPok\u00E9mon does, it\u2019d be like I became a Pok\u00E9mon,\\r\\ndon\u2019t you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You! Would you please put on some clothes with\\na fiery spirit that embodies my burning feelings?"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I appreciate you encouraging me, but I can\u2019t\\nfeel like a Pok\u00E9mon that way.\\c\\nPlease! Show me some clothes with a\\nFire-type design!"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "What\u2019s this? Is that...? I feel like I\u2019ve completely\\nbecome a Pok\u00E9mon.\\c\\nWearing a hot, fire-styled outfit can make\\nyou feel different. I feel like I\u2019ve become a\\r\\nFire-type Pok\u00E9mon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Thanks for cheering me up! It\u2019s hardly a proper\\nreward, but I hope you like it anyway.\\c\\nAcrobatics is a move that does more damage if\\nthe user isn\u2019t holding an item!"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I\u2019ve been thinking... If a Cramorant swallowed me,\\nand then someone else caught it...\\c\\nWould I be able to go inside the Pok\u00E9 Ball, too?\\nIf I did, I\u2019d be the first person in humanity\u2019s history\\r\\nto be caught by a Pok\u00E9 Ball.\\c\\n\u201CGotcha! A man was caught!\u201D They\u2019d have to say\\nsomething like that, right?\\c\\nBasically that means I\u2019d equal a Pok\u00E9mon, no?\\nYeah. Yeah, definitely \u201Cno.\u201D"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "[~ 11]"
  },
